{
  "duration": 79.235,
  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.32,
      "end": 3.088,
      "text": "Here is why the first three seconds"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.128,
      "end": 3.987,
      "text": "matter."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.137,
      "end": 6.92,
      "text": "Most people open a video by giving"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.96,
      "end": 10.038,
      "text": "their name, their channel, and a long"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.078,
      "end": 11.34,
      "text": "introduction."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.49,
      "end": 14.162,
      "text": "But the person watching is not there"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.202,
      "end": 15.801,
      "text": "for the introduction."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.951,
      "end": 17.821,
      "text": "They are there for the promise."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.971,
      "end": 20.711,
      "text": "If you start with the surprise, they"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.751,
      "end": 22.866,
      "text": "have a reason to stick around."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.666,
      "end": 26.389,
      "text": "Writing a short can feel like editing"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.429,
      "end": 27.99,
      "text": "a film in reverse."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.14,
      "end": 31.245,
      "text": "Find the sentence that makes sense without"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.285,
      "end": 33,
      "text": "the rest of your video."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.15,
      "end": 35.714,
      "text": "Then back up just long enough to"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.754,
      "end": 37.437,
      "text": "make the payoff land."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.587,
      "end": 40.293,
      "text": "A good rule: if someone has to"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.333,
      "end": 42.849,
      "text": "ask who or what you mean, you"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.889,
      "end": 44.444,
      "text": "started too late."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.244,
      "end": 47.553,
      "text": "What if your best clip does not"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.593,
      "end": 49.343,
      "text": "have the loudest moment?"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.493,
      "end": 51.797,
      "text": "A quiet line can be the most"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.837,
      "end": 53.754,
      "text": "powerful part of a story."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.904,
      "end": 56.471,
      "text": "Listen for a change of pace, a"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.511,
      "end": 59.397,
      "text": "question, or a moment where your guest"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.437,
      "end": 61.061,
      "text": "changes their mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.211,
      "end": 63.685,
      "text": "These are the small shifts that make"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.725,
      "end": 66.839,
      "text": "someone stop scrolling and start listening."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.639,
      "end": 70.816,
      "text": "One last tip: read your captions with"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.856,
      "end": 72.283,
      "text": "the audio muted."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.433,
      "end": 75.286,
      "text": "If the story still makes sense, you"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.326,
      "end": 78.19,
      "text": "have made something a stranger can watch"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.23,
      "end": 79.085,
      "text": "anywhere."
    }
  ]
}
